window.MGProseData("652d51a464e249806b471022566226e37bc77f822833cd1e4a795479921d8273",{"html":"\u003cp>已完整完成并严格对齐本章全部 \u003cstrong>40 项义务\u003c/strong>，无未完成或未确认范围。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>验证结果：\u003c/p>\n\u003cul>\n\u003cli>\u003ccode>Main.lean\u003c/code> 及全部目标模块在 Lean 4.29.1 / 指定 mathlib 下编译通过。\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>\u003ccode>alignment.json\u003c/code> 已核对：恰好覆盖 40 个义务 ID，均为 \u003ccode>complete\u003c/code>，所列声明均存在。\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>未使用 \u003ccode>sorry\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>admit\u003c/code>、新增公理或跳过内核检查的设施。\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>公理审计仅出现 \u003ccode>propext\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Classical.choice\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>Quot.sound\u003c/code>。\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>两份冻结前置模块未修改。\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ul>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-lean\">import formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Basic\nimport formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Bounds\nimport formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Chains\nimport formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Paths\nimport formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Channels\n\n/-!\n# HCH02 — Operator bounds\n\nThis root module imports the complete Chapter 2 formalization.  The two\nChapter 1 modules under `formal_oet/vol_01/ch_01_foundations` are frozen\nprerequisites and are not modified by this delivery.\n-/\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-lean\">import Mathlib.Data.ENNReal.Basic\nimport Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul\nimport Mathlib.Tactic\nimport formal_oet.vol_01.ch_01_foundations.operator_space\n\nnamespace formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\nopen scoped BigOperators ENNReal\nopen formal_oet.vol_01.ch_01_foundations\n\nuniverse u v\n\n/-- HC02-D03.  A bound matrix is stored input first: `M i j` is the\ncoefficient from input component `i` to output component `j`. -/\nabbrev BoundMatrix (I : Type u) := I → I → ENNReal\n\n/-- HC02-D03.  The usual displayed matrix has output `j` as its row and\ninput `i` as its column. -/\ndef displayMatrix {I : Type u} (M : BoundMatrix I) : Matrix I I ENNReal :=\n  fun j i =\u0026gt; M i j\n\n/-- Convert an ordinarily displayed matrix back to input-first storage. -/\ndef inputMatrix {I : Type u} (A : Matrix I I ENNReal) : BoundMatrix I :=\n  fun i j =\u0026gt; A j i\n\n@[simp] theorem inputMatrix_displayMatrix {I : Type u} (M : BoundMatrix I) :\n    inputMatrix (displayMatrix M) = M := rfl\n\n@[simp] theorem displayMatrix_inputMatrix {I : Type u} (A : Matrix I I ENNReal) :\n    displayMatrix (inputMatrix A) = A := rfl\n\n/-- HC02-D03.  This is `(M₂ M₁) i j = ∑ k, M₂ k j * M₁ i k`. -/\nnoncomputable def boundMul {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (M₂ M₁ : BoundMatrix I) : BoundMatrix I :=\n  fun i j =\u0026gt; ∑ k : I, M₂ k j * M₁ i k\n\n@[simp] theorem boundMul_apply {I : Type u} [Fintype I]\n    (M₂ M₁ : BoundMatrix I) (i j : I) :\n    boundMul M₂ M₁ i j = ∑ k : I, M₂ k j * M₁ i k := rfl\n\n/-- HC02-D03: input-first multiplication is ordinary matrix multiplication\nafter exchanging rows and columns. -/\ntheorem displayMatrix_boundMul {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (M₂ M₁ : BoundMatrix I) :\n    displayMatrix (boundMul M₂ M₁) = displayMatrix M₂ * displayMatrix M₁ := by\n  ext j i\n  simp [displayMatrix, boundMul, Matrix.mul_apply]\n\n/-- HC02-D04.  The identity uses the Kronecker delta, with input index first. -/\nnoncomputable def boundIdentity {I : Type u} : BoundMatrix I := by\n  classical\n  exact fun i j =\u0026gt; if i = j then 1 else 0\n\n/-- HC02-D04.  The ordered product of `A 0, ..., A (n-1)` is\n`A (n-1) * ... * A 0`; the empty product is the identity. -/\nnoncomputable def orderedProduct {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) :\n    ℕ → BoundMatrix I\n  | 0 =\u0026gt; boundIdentity\n  | n + 1 =\u0026gt; boundMul (A n) (orderedProduct A n)\n\n@[simp] theorem orderedProduct_zero {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) :\n    orderedProduct A 0 = boundIdentity := rfl\n\n/-- HC02-D01.  Restricted Lipschitz certificates.  Membership includes the\nstated restriction-domain condition. -/\ndef IsRestrictedLip {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (L : BoundMatrix I) : Prop :=\n  U ⊆ dom ϕ ∧\n    ∀ x ∈ U, ∀ y ∈ U, ∀ j : I,\n      d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ ∑ i : I, L i j * d i x y\n\n/-- HC02-D01.  The family of restricted Lipschitz certificates. -/\ndef restrictedLipCertificates {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) : Set (BoundMatrix I) :=\n  {L | IsRestrictedLip d ϕ U L}\n\n/-- HC02-D01.  Global certificates are certificates on `dom ϕ`. -/\ndef lipCertificates {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) : Set (BoundMatrix I) :=\n  restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ (dom ϕ)\n\n/-- HC02-D02.  Restricted co-Lipschitz certificates, including nonemptiness\nof the restriction domain as part of the definition. -/\ndef IsRestrictedCoLip {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (K : BoundMatrix I) : Prop :=\n  U.Nonempty ∧ U ⊆ dom ϕ ∧\n    ∀ x ∈ U, ∀ y ∈ U, ∀ j : I,\n      (∑ i : I, K i j * d i x y) ≤ d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y)\n\n/-- HC02-D02.  The family of restricted co-Lipschitz certificates. -/\ndef restrictedCoLipCertificates {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) : Set (BoundMatrix I) :=\n  {K | IsRestrictedCoLip d ϕ U K}\n\n/-- HC02-D02.  Global co-Lipschitz certificates use `dom ϕ`; in particular,\nthis family is defined only when that domain is nonempty. -/\ndef coLipCertificates {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) : Set (BoundMatrix I) :=\n  restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ (dom ϕ)\n\n/-- HC02-P04.  Entrywise infimum over a family of matrix certificates. -/\nnoncomputable def entryInf {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I) : ENNReal :=\n  sInf ((fun L : BoundMatrix I =\u0026gt; L i j) '' restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U)\n\n/-- HC02-D07.  A component channel is an input/output pair. -/\nabbrev ComponentChannel (I : Type u) := I × I\n\n/-- HC02-D07.  In output row `j`, only input position `i` may be nonzero. -/\ndef RowSparse {I : Type u} (L : BoundMatrix I) (i j : I) : Prop :=\n  ∀ k : I, k ≠ i → L k j = 0\n\n/-- HC02-D07.  Existence of a single supporting input in output row `j`. -/\ndef RowDecoupled {I : Type u} (L : BoundMatrix I) (j : I) : Prop :=\n  ∃ i : I, RowSparse L i j\n\n/-- HC02-D07.  In input column `i`, only output position `j` may be nonzero. -/\ndef ColumnSparse {I : Type u} (L : BoundMatrix I) (i j : I) : Prop :=\n  ∀ k : I, k ≠ j → L i k = 0\n\n/-- HC02-D07.  Existence of a single supporting output in input column `i`. -/\ndef ColumnDecoupled {I : Type u} (L : BoundMatrix I) (i : I) : Prop :=\n  ∃ j : I, ColumnSparse L i j\n\n/-- HC02-D07.  A completely decoupled certificate is diagonal. -/\ndef Diagonal {I : Type u} (L : BoundMatrix I) : Prop :=\n  ∀ i j : I, i ≠ j → L i j = 0\n\n/-- HC02-D08.  Feasible scalar constants for one component channel. -/\ndef scalarFeasible {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I) : Set ENNReal :=\n  {lam | ∀ x ∈ U, ∀ y ∈ U, d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ lam * d i x y}\n\n/-- HC02-D08.  The optimal single-channel constant.  In `ENNReal`,\n`sInf ∅ = ∞`, exactly as required by the text. -/\nnoncomputable def channelLip {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I) : ENNReal :=\n  sInf (scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j)\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  The actual input domain after zero steps is `U`; after the\nnext step it is the image under that step. -/\ndef actualDomain {X : Type} {bot : X} (U : Set X)\n    (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot) : ℕ → Set X\n  | 0 =\u0026gt; U\n  | n + 1 =\u0026gt; (ϕ n).func '' actualDomain U ϕ n\n\n/-- HC02-D04/D05.  The finite operator chain in application order. -/\ndef operatorChain {X : Type} {bot : X} (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot) :\n    ℕ → Operator X bot\n  | 0 =\u0026gt; OperatorChain []\n  | n + 1 =\u0026gt; OperatorChain [ϕ n, operatorChain ϕ n]\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  Every local Lip bound is imposed on the actual input domain\nof its own step; no final-composite bound occurs in this predicate. -/\ndef LipChainValid {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (L : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) : ℕ → Prop\n  | 0 =\u0026gt; True\n  | n + 1 =\u0026gt; LipChainValid d U ϕ L n ∧\n      L n ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (ϕ n) (actualDomain U ϕ n)\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  The analogous local co-Lip chain data. -/\ndef CoLipChainValid {X : Type} {I : Type u} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (K : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) : ℕ → Prop\n  | 0 =\u0026gt; True\n  | n + 1 =\u0026gt; CoLipChainValid d U ϕ K n ∧\n      K n ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (ϕ n) (actualDomain U ϕ n)\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  Complete finite index paths.  `single` is the unique empty\nintermediate sequence at length one.  `snoc` appends one final edge; the old\nterminal index becomes the last intermediate index. -/\ninductive IndexPath (I : Type u) : ℕ → I → I → Type u where\n  | single (i j : I) : IndexPath I 1 i j\n  | snoc {n : ℕ} {i k : I} (p : IndexPath I n i k) (j : I) : IndexPath I (n + 1) i j\n\nnamespace IndexPath\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  The intermediate index sequence `(k₁,...,k_{n-1})`. -/\ndef intermediate {I : Type u} {n : ℕ} {i j : I} : IndexPath I n i j → List I\n  | .single _ _ =\u0026gt; []\n  | .snoc (k := k) p _ =\u0026gt; intermediate p ++ [k]\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  The path weight, namely the product of its edge entries in\napplication order. -/\nnoncomputable def weight {I : Type u} (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I} :\n    IndexPath I n i j → ENNReal\n  | .single i j =\u0026gt; A 0 i j\n  | .snoc (n := n) (k := k) p j =\u0026gt; weight A p * A n k j\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  Every edge on the path is strictly positive. -/\ndef AllPositive {I : Type u} (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I} :\n    IndexPath I n i j → Prop\n  | .single i j =\u0026gt; 0 \u0026lt; A 0 i j\n  | .snoc (n := n) (k := k) p j =\u0026gt; AllPositive A p ∧ 0 \u0026lt; A n k j\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  At least one edge on the path is zero. -/\ndef HasZero {I : Type u} (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I} :\n    IndexPath I n i j → Prop\n  | .single i j =\u0026gt; A 0 i j = 0\n  | .snoc (n := n) (k := k) p j =\u0026gt; HasZero A p ∨ A n k j = 0\n\nend IndexPath\n\nend formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-lean\">import formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Basic\n\nnamespace formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\nopen scoped BigOperators ENNReal Classical\nopen formal_oet.vol_01.ch_01_foundations\n\nuniverse u\n\n@[simp] theorem boundIdentity_apply {I : Type u} (i j : I) :\n    boundIdentity i j = if i = j then 1 else 0 := by\n  classical\n  rfl\n\n/-- HC02-D04.  Right identity for input-first multiplication. -/\ntheorem boundMul_identity_right {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (M : BoundMatrix I) :\n    boundMul M boundIdentity = M := by\n  classical\n  ext i j\n  simp [boundMul, boundIdentity]\n\n/-- HC02-D04.  Left identity for input-first multiplication. -/\ntheorem boundMul_identity_left {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (M : BoundMatrix I) :\n    boundMul boundIdentity M = M := by\n  classical\n  ext i j\n  simp [boundMul, boundIdentity]\n\n/-- HC02-D04.  A one-step ordered product is its unique matrix. -/\n@[simp] theorem orderedProduct_one {I : Type u} [Fintype I] (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) :\n    orderedProduct A 1 = A 0 := by\n  exact boundMul_identity_right (A 0)\n\n@[simp] theorem identity_bound_sum {I X : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (x y : X) (j : I) :\n    (∑ i : I, boundIdentity i j * d i x y) = d j x y := by\n  classical\n  simp [boundIdentity]\n\n/-- HC02-P14.  The identity matrix is a Lip certificate for the empty\noperator chain. -/\ntheorem identity_lip {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X)\n    (hU : U ⊆ dom (OperatorChain ([] : List (Operator X bot)))) :\n    boundIdentity ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (OperatorChain ([] : List (Operator X bot))) U := by\n  refine ⟨hU, ?_⟩\n  intro x hx y hy j\n  change d j x y ≤ ∑ i : I, boundIdentity i j * d i x y\n  exact (identity_bound_sum d x y j).ge\n\n/-- HC02-P15.  On the same nonempty legal domain, the identity matrix is\nalso a co-Lip certificate. -/\ntheorem identity_coLip {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (hUne : U.Nonempty)\n    (hU : U ⊆ dom (OperatorChain ([] : List (Operator X bot)))) :\n    boundIdentity ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (OperatorChain ([] : List (Operator X bot))) U := by\n  refine ⟨hUne, hU, ?_⟩\n  intro x hx y hy j\n  change (∑ i : I, boundIdentity i j * d i x y) ≤ d j x y\n  exact (identity_bound_sum d x y j).le\n\n/-- HC02-P01.  On a singleton index type the matrix condition is exactly\nthe displayed scalar inequality. -/\ntheorem lip_unique {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I] [Unique I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (L : BoundMatrix I) :\n    L ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U ↔\n      U ⊆ dom ϕ ∧ ∀ x ∈ U, ∀ y ∈ U,\n        d default (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ L default default * d default x y := by\n  constructor\n  · intro hL\n    refine ⟨hL.1, ?_⟩\n    intro x hx y hy\n    simpa using hL.2 x hx y hy default\n  · rintro ⟨hU, hscalar⟩\n    refine ⟨hU, ?_⟩\n    intro x hx y hy j\n    have hj : j = default := Subsingleton.elim _ _\n    subst j\n    simpa using hscalar x hx y hy\n\n/-- The same singleton degeneration with an explicitly named unique index. -/\ntheorem lip_singleton {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (L : BoundMatrix I)\n    (i₀ : I) (hI : ∀ k : I, k = i₀) :\n    L ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U ↔\n      U ⊆ dom ϕ ∧ ∀ x ∈ U, ∀ y ∈ U,\n        d i₀ (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ L i₀ i₀ * d i₀ x y := by\n  letI : Unique I := { toInhabited := ⟨i₀⟩, uniq := hI }\n  exact lip_unique d ϕ U L\n\n/-- HC02-P02.  A global Lip certificate restricts to every legal subset. -/\ntheorem lip_global_subset_restricted {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (hU : U ⊆ dom ϕ) :\n    lipCertificates d ϕ ⊆ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U := by\n  intro L hL\n  exact ⟨hU, fun x hx y hy j =\u0026gt; hL.2 x (hU hx) y (hU hy) j⟩\n\n/-- HC02-P03.  Shrinking the evaluation domain enlarges the certificate family. -/\ntheorem restrictedLip_mono {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) {U V : Set X}\n    (hUV : U ⊆ V) :\n    restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ V ⊆ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U := by\n  intro L hL\n  exact ⟨hUV.trans hL.1, fun x hx y hy j =\u0026gt; hL.2 x (hUV hx) y (hUV hy) j⟩\n\n/-- HC02-P04.  Entrywise infima do not increase when the evaluation domain\nis enlarged. -/\ntheorem entryInf_mono {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) {U V : Set X}\n    (hUV : U ⊆ V) (i j : I) :\n    entryInf d ϕ U i j ≤ entryInf d ϕ V i j := by\n  apply sInf_le_sInf\n  exact Set.image_mono (restrictedLip_mono d ϕ hUV)\n\n/-- The extended-nonnegative-real finite-sum calculation shared by the Lip\nand co-Lip composition laws. -/\ntheorem weighted_sum_exchange {I : Type u} [Fintype I]\n    (M₂ M₁ : BoundMatrix I) (w : I → ENNReal) (j : I) :\n    (∑ k : I, M₂ k j * (∑ i : I, M₁ i k * w i)) =\n      ∑ i : I, boundMul M₂ M₁ i j * w i := by\n  classical\n  simp_rw [boundMul, Finset.mul_sum, Finset.sum_mul, mul_assoc]\n  exact Finset.sum_comm\n\n/-- HC02-P05.  Two-step Lipschitz composition on the actual intermediate\nimage domain. -/\ntheorem lip_comp_two {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U₁ : Set X)\n    (L₁ L₂ : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hU₁ : U₁ ⊆ dom (OperatorChain [ϕ₂, ϕ₁]))\n    (hL₁ : L₁ ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ₁ U₁)\n    (hL₂ : L₂ ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ₂ (ϕ₁.func '' U₁)) :\n    boundMul L₂ L₁ ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (OperatorChain [ϕ₂, ϕ₁]) U₁ := by\n  refine ⟨hU₁, ?_⟩\n  intro x hx y hy j\n  change d j (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func x)) (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func y)) ≤\n    ∑ i : I, boundMul L₂ L₁ i j * d i x y\n  calc\n    d j (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func x)) (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func y)) ≤\n        ∑ k : I, L₂ k j * d k (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) :=\n      hL₂.2 (ϕ₁.func x) ⟨x, hx, rfl⟩ (ϕ₁.func y) ⟨y, hy, rfl⟩ j\n    _ ≤ ∑ k : I, L₂ k j * (∑ i : I, L₁ i k * d i x y) := by\n      apply Finset.sum_le_sum\n      intro k hk\n      exact mul_le_mul_left' (hL₁.2 x hx y hy k) _\n    _ = ∑ i : I, boundMul L₂ L₁ i j * d i x y :=\n      weighted_sum_exchange L₂ L₁ (fun i =\u0026gt; d i x y) j\n\n/-- HC02-P07.  Two-step co-Lipschitz composition on the actual intermediate\nimage domain. -/\ntheorem coLip_comp_two {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U₁ : Set X)\n    (K₁ K₂ : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hU₁ : U₁ ⊆ dom (OperatorChain [ϕ₂, ϕ₁]))\n    (hK₁ : K₁ ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ₁ U₁)\n    (hK₂ : K₂ ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ₂ (ϕ₁.func '' U₁)) :\n    boundMul K₂ K₁ ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (OperatorChain [ϕ₂, ϕ₁]) U₁ := by\n  refine ⟨hK₁.1, hU₁, ?_⟩\n  intro x hx y hy j\n  change (∑ i : I, boundMul K₂ K₁ i j * d i x y) ≤\n    d j (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func x)) (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func y))\n  calc\n    (∑ i : I, boundMul K₂ K₁ i j * d i x y) =\n        ∑ k : I, K₂ k j * (∑ i : I, K₁ i k * d i x y) :=\n      (weighted_sum_exchange K₂ K₁ (fun i =\u0026gt; d i x y) j).symm\n    _ ≤ ∑ k : I, K₂ k j * d k (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) := by\n      apply Finset.sum_le_sum\n      intro k hk\n      exact mul_le_mul_left' (hK₁.2.2 x hx y hy k) _\n    _ ≤ d j (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func x)) (ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func y)) :=\n      hK₂.2.2 (ϕ₁.func x) ⟨x, hx, rfl⟩ (ϕ₁.func y) ⟨y, hy, rfl⟩ j\n\n/-- HC02-P06.  A zero output distance together with positive input distance\nforces the corresponding global co-Lip entry to vanish. -/\ntheorem coLip_entry_eq_zero_of_output_zero {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (K : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hK : K ∈ coLipCertificates d ϕ) (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ dom ϕ) (hy : y ∈ dom ϕ)\n    (i j : I) (hout : d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) = 0) (hin : 0 \u0026lt; d i x y) :\n    K i j = 0 := by\n  have hsum : (∑ k : I, K k j * d k x y) = 0 := by\n    apply le_antisymm\n    · simpa [hout] using hK.2.2 x hx y hy j\n    · exact zero_le _\n  have hterm_le : K i j * d i x y ≤ ∑ k : I, K k j * d k x y := by\n    exact Finset.single_le_sum (fun k _ =\u0026gt; zero_le (K k j * d k x y)) (Finset.mem_univ i)\n  have hterm : K i j * d i x y = 0 :=\n    le_antisymm (hterm_le.trans_eq hsum) (zero_le _)\n  by_contra hKne\n  have hpos : 0 \u0026lt; K i j * d i x y := ENNReal.mul_pos hKne hin.ne'\n  rw [hterm] at hpos\n  exact (lt_irrefl 0) hpos\n\n/-- HC02-P08.  Forward point-pair image-distance perturbation. -/\ntheorem perturbation_forward {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal)\n    (hd : ∀ i : I, ExtendedPseudoMetric X bot (d i))\n    (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (δ : I → ENNReal)\n    (hδ : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ j : I, d j (ϕ₁.func z) (ϕ₂.func z) ≤ δ j)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) (j : I) :\n    d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) ≤\n      d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) + δ j + δ j := by\n  have hδrev : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ j : I, d j (ϕ₂.func z) (ϕ₁.func z) ≤ δ j := by\n    intro z hz k\n    rw [(hd k).symm (ϕ₂.func z) (ϕ₁.func z)]\n    exact hδ z hz k\n  calc\n    d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) ≤\n        d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₁.func x) + d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) :=\n      (hd j).triangle _ _ _\n    _ ≤ d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₁.func x) +\n        (d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) + d j (ϕ₁.func y) (ϕ₂.func y)) :=\n      add_le_add (le_refl _) ((hd j).triangle _ _ _)\n    _ ≤ δ j + (d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) + δ j) :=\n      add_le_add (hδrev x hx j) (add_le_add (le_refl _) (hδ y hy j))\n    _ = d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) + δ j + δ j := by\n      rw [← add_assoc, add_comm (δ j) (d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y)), add_assoc]\n\n/-- HC02-P09.  The reverse point-pair perturbation follows by symmetry. -/\ntheorem perturbation_reverse {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal)\n    (hd : ∀ i : I, ExtendedPseudoMetric X bot (d i))\n    (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (δ : I → ENNReal)\n    (hδ : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ j : I, d j (ϕ₁.func z) (ϕ₂.func z) ≤ δ j)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) (j : I) :\n    d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) ≤\n      d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) + δ j + δ j := by\n  apply perturbation_forward d hd ϕ₂ ϕ₁ U δ\n  · intro z hz k\n    rw [(hd k).symm (ϕ₂.func z) (ϕ₁.func z)]\n    exact hδ z hz k\n  · exact hx\n  · exact hy\n\n/-- HC02-P10.  Additive perturbation of a Lip upper bound. -/\ntheorem perturbation_lip {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal)\n    (hd : ∀ i : I, ExtendedPseudoMetric X bot (d i))\n    (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (δ : I → ENNReal) (L₁ : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hδ : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ j : I, d j (ϕ₁.func z) (ϕ₂.func z) ≤ δ j)\n    (hL₁ : L₁ ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ₁ U)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) (j : I) :\n    d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) ≤\n      (∑ i : I, L₁ i j * d i x y) + 2 * δ j := by\n  calc\n    d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) ≤\n        d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) + δ j + δ j :=\n      perturbation_forward d hd ϕ₁ ϕ₂ U δ hδ x y hx hy j\n    _ ≤ (∑ i : I, L₁ i j * d i x y) + δ j + δ j := by\n      exact add_le_add (add_le_add (hL₁.2 x hx y hy j) (le_refl _)) (le_refl _)\n    _ = (∑ i : I, L₁ i j * d i x y) + 2 * δ j := by rw [two_mul]; ac_rfl\n\n/-- HC02-P11.  Additive perturbation of a co-Lip lower bound. -/\ntheorem perturbation_coLip {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal)\n    (hd : ∀ i : I, ExtendedPseudoMetric X bot (d i))\n    (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (δ : I → ENNReal) (K₁ : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hδ : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ j : I, d j (ϕ₁.func z) (ϕ₂.func z) ≤ δ j)\n    (hK₁ : K₁ ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ₁ U)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) (j : I) :\n    (∑ i : I, K₁ i j * d i x y) ≤\n      d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) + 2 * δ j := by\n  calc\n    (∑ i : I, K₁ i j * d i x y) ≤ d j (ϕ₁.func x) (ϕ₁.func y) :=\n      hK₁.2.2 x hx y hy j\n    _ ≤ d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) + δ j + δ j :=\n      perturbation_reverse d hd ϕ₁ ϕ₂ U δ hδ x y hx hy j\n    _ = d j (ϕ₂.func x) (ϕ₂.func y) + 2 * δ j := by rw [two_mul]; ac_rfl\n\n/-- HC02-P25.  A zero matrix coefficient removes its own summand, including\nwhen the corresponding distance is infinite. -/\ntheorem zero_coefficient_term {I X : Type} (L : BoundMatrix I)\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (i j : I) (x y : X) (hzero : L i j = 0) :\n    L i j * d i x y = 0 := by simp [hzero]\n\n/-- HC02-P25.  The zero input position can be deleted from the finite sum. -/\ntheorem sum_erase_of_coefficient_zero {I X : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (L : BoundMatrix I) (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (i j : I) (x y : X)\n    (hzero : L i j = 0) :\n    (∑ k : I, L k j * d k x y) =\n      ∑ k ∈ Finset.univ.erase i, L k j * d k x y := by\n  classical\n  rw [← Finset.sum_erase_add _ _ (Finset.mem_univ i)]\n  simp [hzero]\n\n/-- HC02-P26.  A single supported input position simplifies an output row. -/\ntheorem lip_row_sparse {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (L : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hL : L ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U) {i j : I}\n    (hrow : RowSparse L i j) (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) :\n    d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ L i j * d i x y := by\n  refine (hL.2 x hx y hy j).trans_eq ?_\n  classical\n  apply Finset.sum_eq_single i\n  · intro k hk hki\n    simp [hrow k hki]\n  · simp\n\n/-- HC02-P27.  A singly supported input column can contribute only to its\ndesignated output position. -/\ntheorem column_sparse_terms_zero {I X : Type}\n    (L : BoundMatrix I) (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) {i j : I}\n    (hcol : ColumnSparse L i j) (x y : X) :\n    ∀ k : I, k ≠ j → L i k * d i x y = 0 := by\n  intro k hk\n  simp [hcol k hk]\n\n/-- HC02-P28.  A diagonal Lip certificate gives scalar bounds on every\ncomponent. -/\ntheorem diagonal_lip_bounds {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (L : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hL : L ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U) (hdiag : Diagonal L)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) (j : I) :\n    d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ L j j * d j x y := by\n  exact lip_row_sparse d ϕ U L hL (fun k hkj =\u0026gt; hdiag k j hkj) x y hx hy\n\n/-- HC02-P29.  Only row sparsity of the Lip certificate is needed for the\nscalar two-sided bound; no sparsity assumption is made on `K`. -/\ntheorem diagonal_input_two_sided {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (L K : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hL : L ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U)\n    (hK : K ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ U) {j : I}\n    (hrow : ∀ k : I, k ≠ j → L k j = 0)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U) :\n    K j j * d j x y ≤ d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ∧\n      d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ L j j * d j x y := by\n  constructor\n  · calc\n      K j j * d j x y ≤ ∑ k : I, K k j * d k x y := by\n        exact Finset.single_le_sum (fun k _ =\u0026gt; zero_le (K k j * d k x y)) (Finset.mem_univ j)\n      _ ≤ d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) := hK.2.2 x hx y hy j\n  · exact lip_row_sparse d ϕ U L hL hrow x y hx hy\n\n/-- HC02-P30.  Componentwise two-sided bounds, including the finite-diagonal\ncoefficient branch. -/\ntheorem all_components_two_sided_finite {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (L K : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hL : L ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d ϕ U)\n    (hK : K ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ U)\n    (hrows : ∀ j k : I, k ≠ j → L k j = 0)\n    (hfinite : ∀ j : I, L j j \u0026lt; ∞ ∧ K j j \u0026lt; ∞) :\n    ∀ j : I, K j j \u0026lt; ∞ ∧ L j j \u0026lt; ∞ ∧\n      ∀ x ∈ U, ∀ y ∈ U,\n        K j j * d j x y ≤ d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ∧\n          d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) ≤ L j j * d j x y := by\n  intro j\n  exact ⟨(hfinite j).2, (hfinite j).1,\n    fun x hx y hy =\u0026gt; diagonal_input_two_sided d ϕ U L K hL hK (hrows j) x y hx hy⟩\n\n/-- HC02-P31.  A positive co-Lip channel preserves distinguishability. -/\ntheorem positive_coLip_channel {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (K : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hK : K ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ U) {i j : I}\n    (hKpos : 0 \u0026lt; K i j) (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U)\n    (hdist : 0 \u0026lt; d i x y) :\n    0 \u0026lt; d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) := by\n  have hterm : K i j * d i x y ≤ ∑ k : I, K k j * d k x y := by\n    exact Finset.single_le_sum (fun k _ =\u0026gt; zero_le (K k j * d k x y)) (Finset.mem_univ i)\n  have hpos : 0 \u0026lt; K i j * d i x y := ENNReal.mul_pos hKpos.ne' hdist.ne'\n  exact hpos.trans_le (hterm.trans (hK.2.2 x hx y hy j))\n\n/-- HC02-P32.  Positive diagonal co-Lip channels reflect the family zero\nrelation. -/\ntheorem positive_diagonal_coLip_reflects {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (K : BoundMatrix I)\n    (hK : K ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d ϕ U)\n    (hdiag : ∀ j : I, 0 \u0026lt; K j j) (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U)\n    (hzero : GaugeZeroRelated d (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y)) :\n    GaugeZeroRelated d x y := by\n  intro j\n  by_contra hj\n  have hpos : 0 \u0026lt; d j x y := pos_iff_ne_zero.mpr hj\n  have hout := positive_coLip_channel d ϕ U K hK (hdiag j) x y hx hy hpos\n  exact hout.ne' (hzero j)\n\nend formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-lean\">import formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Bounds\n\nnamespace formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\nopen scoped BigOperators ENNReal Classical\nopen formal_oet.vol_01.ch_01_foundations\n\n/-- A legal pair composite has a legal first stage. -/\ntheorem dom_of_chain_two_left {X : Type} {bot : X}\n    (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (h : U ⊆ dom (OperatorChain [ϕ₂, ϕ₁])) : U ⊆ dom ϕ₁ := by\n  intro x hx hfirst\n  have hcomp := h hx\n  apply hcomp\n  change ϕ₂.func (ϕ₁.func x) = bot\n  rw [hfirst, ϕ₂.preserves_bot]\n\n/-- A legal pair composite has a legal second stage on the actual image. -/\ntheorem image_sub_dom_chain_two_right {X : Type} {bot : X}\n    (ϕ₁ ϕ₂ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X)\n    (h : U ⊆ dom (OperatorChain [ϕ₂, ϕ₁])) : ϕ₁.func '' U ⊆ dom ϕ₂ := by\n  intro z hz\n  rcases hz with ⟨x, hx, rfl⟩\n  exact h hx\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  The image of the whole composite is exactly the recursively\ncomputed actual domain. -/\ntheorem operatorChain_image {X : Type} {bot : X} (U : Set X)\n    (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot) (n : ℕ) :\n    (operatorChain ϕ n).func '' U = actualDomain U ϕ n := by\n  induction n with\n  | zero =\u0026gt;\n      simp [operatorChain, actualDomain, OperatorChain]\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      calc\n        (operatorChain ϕ (n + 1)).func '' U =\n            ((ϕ n).func ∘ (operatorChain ϕ n).func) '' U := rfl\n        _ = (ϕ n).func '' ((operatorChain ϕ n).func '' U) := Set.image_comp _ _ _\n        _ = actualDomain U ϕ (n + 1) := by rw [ih]; rfl\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  Iterated images are nonempty exactly when the initial set is. -/\ntheorem actualDomain_nonempty_iff {X : Type} {bot : X} (U : Set X)\n    (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot) (n : ℕ) :\n    (actualDomain U ϕ n).Nonempty ↔ U.Nonempty := by\n  induction n with\n  | zero =\u0026gt; rfl\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt; simp [actualDomain, ih]\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  Legality of the full composite implies legality of every\nindividual step on its actual input domain. -/\ntheorem actualDomain_subset_dom {X : Type} {bot : X} (U : Set X)\n    (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot) {n m : ℕ} (hm : m \u0026lt; n)\n    (hdom : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ n)) :\n    actualDomain U ϕ m ⊆ dom (ϕ m) := by\n  induction n generalizing m with\n  | zero =\u0026gt; omega\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      by_cases hmn : m = n\n      · subst m\n        rw [← operatorChain_image]\n        exact image_sub_dom_chain_two_right (operatorChain ϕ n) (ϕ n) U hdom\n      · apply ih (m := m) (by omega)\n        exact dom_of_chain_two_left (operatorChain ϕ n) (ϕ n) U hdom\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  Extract any one local Lip certificate from the recursively\nspecified chain data. -/\ntheorem LipChainValid.step {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (L : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n m : ℕ} (hm : m \u0026lt; n)\n    (hvalid : LipChainValid d U ϕ L n) :\n    L m ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (ϕ m) (actualDomain U ϕ m) := by\n  induction n generalizing m with\n  | zero =\u0026gt; omega\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      by_cases hmn : m = n\n      · subst m\n        exact hvalid.2\n      · exact ih (m := m) (by omega) hvalid.1\n\n/-- HC02-D05.  Extract any one local co-Lip certificate from the recursively\nspecified chain data. -/\ntheorem CoLipChainValid.step {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (K : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n m : ℕ} (hm : m \u0026lt; n)\n    (hvalid : CoLipChainValid d U ϕ K n) :\n    K m ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (ϕ m) (actualDomain U ϕ m) := by\n  induction n generalizing m with\n  | zero =\u0026gt; omega\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      by_cases hmn : m = n\n      · subst m\n        exact hvalid.2\n      · exact ih (m := m) (by omega) hvalid.1\n\n/-- HC02-P12.  The specified ordered product of local Lip certificates is a\ncertificate for the full finite chain. -/\ntheorem lip_orderedProduct_chain {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (L : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ)\n    (hdom : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ n))\n    (hvalid : LipChainValid d U ϕ L n) :\n    orderedProduct L n ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (operatorChain ϕ n) U := by\n  induction n with\n  | zero =\u0026gt; exact identity_lip d U hdom\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      have hprefix : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ n) :=\n        dom_of_chain_two_left (operatorChain ϕ n) (ϕ n) U hdom\n      have hproduct := ih hprefix hvalid.1\n      have hlast : L n ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (ϕ n)\n          ((operatorChain ϕ n).func '' U) := by\n        rw [operatorChain_image]\n        exact hvalid.2\n      exact lip_comp_two d (operatorChain ϕ n) (ϕ n) U\n        (orderedProduct L n) (L n) hdom hproduct hlast\n\n/-- The co-Lip chain induction with an explicit nonempty initial domain. -/\ntheorem coLip_orderedProduct_chain_aux {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (K : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (hU : U.Nonempty) (n : ℕ)\n    (hdom : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ n))\n    (hvalid : CoLipChainValid d U ϕ K n) :\n    orderedProduct K n ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (operatorChain ϕ n) U := by\n  induction n with\n  | zero =\u0026gt; exact identity_coLip d U hU hdom\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      have hprefix : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ n) :=\n        dom_of_chain_two_left (operatorChain ϕ n) (ϕ n) U hdom\n      have hproduct := ih hprefix hvalid.1\n      have hlast : K n ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (ϕ n)\n          ((operatorChain ϕ n).func '' U) := by\n        rw [operatorChain_image]\n        exact hvalid.2\n      exact coLip_comp_two d (operatorChain ϕ n) (ϕ n) U\n        (orderedProduct K n) (K n) hdom hproduct hlast\n\n/-- HC02-P13.  Positive-length co-Lip chain.  Nonemptiness of `U` is derived\nfrom the final local certificate, not added as an extra hypothesis. -/\ntheorem coLip_orderedProduct_chain_succ {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (K : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ)\n    (hdom : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ (n + 1)))\n    (hvalid : CoLipChainValid d U ϕ K (n + 1)) :\n    orderedProduct K (n + 1) ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (operatorChain ϕ (n + 1)) U := by\n  apply coLip_orderedProduct_chain_aux d U ϕ K _ (n + 1) hdom hvalid\n  have himage : (actualDomain U ϕ n).Nonempty := hvalid.2.1\n  exact (actualDomain_nonempty_iff U ϕ n).mp himage\n\n/-- HC02-P14.  Zero-step unit Lip certificate in ordered-product notation. -/\ntheorem zero_step_unit_lip {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (L : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (hU : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ 0)) :\n    orderedProduct L 0 ∈ restrictedLipCertificates d (operatorChain ϕ 0) U := by\n  exact identity_lip d U hU\n\n/-- HC02-P15.  Zero-step unit co-Lip certificate in ordered-product notation. -/\ntheorem zero_step_unit_coLip {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (K : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (hUne : U.Nonempty)\n    (hU : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ 0)) :\n    orderedProduct K 0 ∈ restrictedCoLipCertificates d (operatorChain ϕ 0) U := by\n  exact identity_coLip d U hUne hU\n\nend formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-lean\">import formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Chains\n\nnamespace formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\nopen scoped BigOperators ENNReal Classical\nopen formal_oet.vol_01.ch_01_foundations\n\nnamespace IndexPath\n\n/-- Every path in this representation has positive edge length. -/\ntheorem length_pos {I : Type} {n : ℕ} {i j : I} (p : IndexPath I n i j) : 0 \u0026lt; n := by\n  cases p \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; omega\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  The intermediate list has exactly `n - 1` entries. -/\ntheorem intermediate_length {I : Type} {n : ℕ} {i j : I} (p : IndexPath I n i j) :\n    p.intermediate.length = n - 1 := by\n  induction p with\n  | single =\u0026gt; rfl\n  | @snoc n i k p j ih =\u0026gt;\n      have hn := length_pos p\n      simp only [IndexPath.intermediate, List.length_append, List.length_singleton, ih]\n      omega\n\n/-- At length one, the only path is the empty-intermediate-sequence path. -/\ntheorem eq_single {I : Type} {i j : I} (p : IndexPath I 1 i j) :\n    p = IndexPath.single i j := by\n  cases p with\n  | single =\u0026gt; rfl\n  | snoc p j =\u0026gt; cases p\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  The product weight vanishes exactly when the path has a zero edge. -/\ntheorem weight_eq_zero_iff {I : Type} (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I}\n    (p : IndexPath I n i j) : p.weight A = 0 ↔ p.HasZero A := by\n  induction p with\n  | single =\u0026gt; rfl\n  | snoc p j ih =\u0026gt; simp [IndexPath.weight, IndexPath.HasZero, ih, mul_eq_zero]\n\n/-- HC02-D06.  The product weight is positive exactly when every edge is positive. -/\ntheorem weight_pos_iff {I : Type} (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I}\n    (p : IndexPath I n i j) : 0 \u0026lt; p.weight A ↔ p.AllPositive A := by\n  induction p with\n  | single =\u0026gt; rfl\n  | snoc p j ih =\u0026gt; simp [IndexPath.weight, IndexPath.AllPositive, ih, ENNReal.mul_pos_iff]\n\n/-- Having a zero edge is the negation of being an all-positive path. -/\ntheorem hasZero_iff_not_allPositive {I : Type} (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I}\n    (p : IndexPath I n i j) : p.HasZero A ↔ ¬ p.AllPositive A := by\n  rw [← weight_eq_zero_iff, ← weight_pos_iff]\n  simp [pos_iff_ne_zero]\n\nend IndexPath\n\n/-- A positive ordered-product entry supplies a complete all-positive path. -/\ntheorem exists_allPositive_path_of_orderedProduct_pos {I : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ) (i j : I)\n    (h : 0 \u0026lt; orderedProduct A (n + 1) i j) :\n    ∃ p : IndexPath I (n + 1) i j, p.AllPositive A := by\n  induction n generalizing i j with\n  | zero =\u0026gt;\n      exact ⟨IndexPath.single i j, by simpa using h⟩\n  | succ n ih =\u0026gt;\n      change 0 \u0026lt; ∑ k : I, A (n + 1) k j * orderedProduct A (n + 1) i k at h\n      have hex : ∃ k : I, 0 \u0026lt; A (n + 1) k j * orderedProduct A (n + 1) i k := by\n        simpa using (Finset.sum_pos_iff.mp h)\n      obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := hex\n      have hparts := ENNReal.mul_pos_iff.mp hk\n      obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := ih i k hparts.2\n      exact ⟨IndexPath.snoc p j, hp, hparts.1⟩\n\n/-- Every all-positive path forces the corresponding ordered-product entry\nto be positive. -/\ntheorem orderedProduct_pos_of_allPositive_path {I : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) {n : ℕ} {i j : I}\n    (p : IndexPath I n i j) (hp : p.AllPositive A) :\n    0 \u0026lt; orderedProduct A n i j := by\n  induction p with\n  | single i j =\u0026gt; simpa using hp\n  | @snoc n i k p j ih =\u0026gt;\n      change 0 \u0026lt; ∑ l : I, A n l j * orderedProduct A n i l\n      apply Finset.sum_pos_iff.mpr\n      refine ⟨k, Finset.mem_univ k, ?_⟩\n      exact ENNReal.mul_pos_iff.mpr ⟨hp.2, ih hp.1⟩\n\n/-- HC02-P17, algebraic form.  Positivity of an ordered-product entry is\nequivalent to existence of one all-positive complete path. -/\ntheorem orderedProduct_pos_iff {I : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ) (i j : I) :\n    0 \u0026lt; orderedProduct A (n + 1) i j ↔\n      ∃ p : IndexPath I (n + 1) i j, p.AllPositive A := by\n  constructor\n  · exact exists_allPositive_path_of_orderedProduct_pos A n i j\n  · rintro ⟨p, hp⟩\n    exact orderedProduct_pos_of_allPositive_path A p hp\n\n/-- HC02-P16, algebraic form.  Vanishing is equivalent to every complete\npath containing at least one zero edge. -/\ntheorem orderedProduct_zero_iff {I : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ) (i j : I) :\n    orderedProduct A (n + 1) i j = 0 ↔\n      ∀ p : IndexPath I (n + 1) i j, p.HasZero A := by\n  constructor\n  · intro h p\n    apply (IndexPath.hasZero_iff_not_allPositive A p).mpr\n    intro hp\n    have hpos := (orderedProduct_pos_iff A n i j).mpr ⟨p, hp⟩\n    rw [h] at hpos\n    exact (lt_irrefl 0) hpos\n  · intro h\n    by_contra hne\n    obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := (orderedProduct_pos_iff A n i j).mp (pos_iff_ne_zero.mpr hne)\n    have hz := h p\n    exact (IndexPath.hasZero_iff_not_allPositive A p).mp hz hp\n\n/-- The `n = 1` zero criterion is the unique matrix entry itself. -/\ntheorem orderedProduct_one_zero_iff {I : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (i j : I) :\n    A 0 i j = 0 ↔ ∀ p : IndexPath I 1 i j, p.HasZero A := by\n  simpa using orderedProduct_zero_iff A 0 i j\n\n/-- The `n = 1` positive criterion is the unique matrix entry itself. -/\ntheorem orderedProduct_one_pos_iff {I : Type} [Fintype I]\n    (A : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (i j : I) :\n    0 \u0026lt; A 0 i j ↔ ∃ p : IndexPath I 1 i j, p.AllPositive A := by\n  simpa using orderedProduct_pos_iff A 0 i j\n\n/-- HC02-P16.  The zero-entry criterion in the same nonempty Lip-chain\ncontext as the text. -/\ntheorem lip_chain_product_zero_iff {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I] [Nonempty I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (L : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ)\n    (_hdom : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ (n + 1)))\n    (_hvalid : LipChainValid d U ϕ L (n + 1)) (i j : I) :\n    orderedProduct L (n + 1) i j = 0 ↔\n      ∀ p : IndexPath I (n + 1) i j, p.HasZero L := by\n  exact orderedProduct_zero_iff L n i j\n\n/-- HC02-P17.  The positive-entry criterion in the same nonempty co-Lip-chain\ncontext as the text. -/\ntheorem coLip_chain_product_pos_iff {X I : Type} {bot : X} [Fintype I] [Nonempty I]\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (U : Set X) (ϕ : ℕ → Operator X bot)\n    (K : ℕ → BoundMatrix I) (n : ℕ)\n    (_hdom : U ⊆ dom (operatorChain ϕ (n + 1)))\n    (_hvalid : CoLipChainValid d U ϕ K (n + 1)) (i j : I) :\n    0 \u0026lt; orderedProduct K (n + 1) i j ↔\n      ∃ p : IndexPath I (n + 1) i j, p.AllPositive K := by\n  exact orderedProduct_pos_iff K n i j\n\nend formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-lean\">import formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Chains\n\nnamespace formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\nopen scoped BigOperators ENNReal Classical\nopen formal_oet.vol_01.ch_01_foundations\n\n/-- HC02-P20.  The scalar feasible family is upward closed. -/\ntheorem scalarFeasible_upward {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    {lam₀ lam₁ : ENNReal}\n    (h₀ : lam₀ ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j) (hle : lam₀ ≤ lam₁) :\n    lam₁ ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j := by\n  intro x hx y hy\n  exact (h₀ x hx y hy).trans (mul_le_mul_right' hle _)\n\n/-- Every constant strictly above the channel infimum is feasible. -/\ntheorem feasible_of_channelLip_lt {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    {lam : ENNReal} (h : channelLip d ϕ U i j \u0026lt; lam) :\n    lam ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j := by\n  obtain ⟨mu, hmu, hmulam⟩ := sInf_lt_iff.mp h\n  exact scalarFeasible_upward d ϕ U i j hmu hmulam.le\n\n/-- HC02-P21.  The above-infimum feasibility statement in the positive\nfinite context of the text. -/\ntheorem feasible_above_positive_finite_channelLip {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    (_ha : 0 \u0026lt; channelLip d ϕ U i j) (_hfin : channelLip d ϕ U i j \u0026lt; ∞)\n    {lam : ENNReal} (h : channelLip d ϕ U i j \u0026lt; lam) :\n    lam ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j := by\n  exact feasible_of_channelLip_lt d ϕ U i j h\n\n/-- HC02-P22.  If the infimum is zero, every finite strictly positive\nconstant is feasible. -/\ntheorem feasible_of_channelLip_eq_zero {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    (ha : channelLip d ϕ U i j = 0) {lam : ENNReal}\n    (hpos : 0 \u0026lt; lam) (_hfin : lam \u0026lt; ∞) :\n    lam ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j := by\n  apply feasible_of_channelLip_lt d ϕ U i j\n  rwa [ha]\n\n/-- HC02-P18.  A zero input distance with positive output distance rules out\nevery extended scalar constant. -/\ntheorem scalarFeasible_eq_empty_of_zero_input_positive_output {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U)\n    (hin : d i x y = 0) (hout : 0 \u0026lt; d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y)) :\n    scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j = ∅ := by\n  apply Set.eq_empty_iff_forall_notMem.mpr\n  intro lam hlam\n  have hbound := hlam x hx y hy\n  rw [hin, mul_zero] at hbound\n  exact (not_le_of_gt hout) hbound\n\n/-- HC02-P18.  Consequently, the single-channel infimum is `+∞`. -/\ntheorem channelLip_eq_top_of_zero_input_positive_output {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    (x y : X) (hx : x ∈ U) (hy : y ∈ U)\n    (hin : d i x y = 0) (hout : 0 \u0026lt; d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y)) :\n    channelLip d ϕ U i j = ∞ := by\n  rw [channelLip, scalarFeasible_eq_empty_of_zero_input_positive_output\n    d ϕ U i j x y hx hy hin hout]\n  exact sInf_empty\n\n/-- HC02-P19.  A positive finite optimal single-channel constant is itself\nfeasible. -/\ntheorem channelLip_mem_of_pos_finite {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I)\n    (ha : 0 \u0026lt; channelLip d ϕ U i j) (hfin : channelLip d ϕ U i j \u0026lt; ∞) :\n    channelLip d ϕ U i j ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j := by\n  intro x hx y hy\n  by_cases hBzero : d i x y = 0\n  · obtain ⟨lam, halam, hlamfin⟩ := exists_between hfin\n    have hbound := (feasible_of_channelLip_lt d ϕ U i j halam) x hx y hy\n    rw [hBzero, mul_zero] at hbound\n    have hAzero : d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) = 0 := le_antisymm hbound (zero_le _)\n    simp [hBzero, hAzero]\n  by_cases hBtop : d i x y = ∞\n  · rw [hBtop, ENNReal.mul_top ha.ne']\n    exact le_top\n  · have hBpos : 0 \u0026lt; d i x y := pos_iff_ne_zero.mpr hBzero\n    by_contra hnot\n    have hlt : channelLip d ϕ U i j * d i x y \u0026lt; d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) :=\n      lt_of_not_ge hnot\n    have hadiv : channelLip d ϕ U i j \u0026lt; d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) / d i x y :=\n      (ENNReal.lt_div_iff_mul_lt (Or.inl hBzero) (Or.inl hBtop)).mpr hlt\n    obtain ⟨lam, halam, hlamdiv⟩ := exists_between hadiv\n    have hbound := (feasible_of_channelLip_lt d ϕ U i j halam) x hx y hy\n    have hlamlt : lam * d i x y \u0026lt; d j (ϕ.func x) (ϕ.func y) :=\n      ENNReal.mul_lt_of_lt_div hlamdiv\n    exact (not_lt_of_ge hbound) hlamlt\n\n/-- HC02-P24.  Finiteness of the channel infimum is equivalent to existence\nof one finite feasible constant. -/\ntheorem channelLip_lt_top_iff_exists_finite {X I : Type} {bot : X}\n    (d : I → X → X → ENNReal) (ϕ : Operator X bot) (U : Set X) (i j : I) :\n    channelLip d ϕ U i j \u0026lt; ∞ ↔\n      ∃ lam : ENNReal, lam \u0026lt; ∞ ∧ lam ∈ scalarFeasible d ϕ U i j := by\n  constructor\n  · intro h\n    obtain ⟨lam, hlam, hlamtop⟩ := sInf_lt_iff.mp h\n    exact ⟨lam, hlamtop, hlam⟩\n  · rintro ⟨lam, hlamtop, hlam⟩\n    exact (sInf_le hlam).trans_lt hlamtop\n\n/-! ### The zero-infimum counterexample -/\n\n/-- HC02-P23.  Two nonabsorbing points and one absorbing point. -/\nabbrev CounterPoint := Option Bool\n\n/-- The absorbing point of the counterexample. -/\ndef counterBot : CounterPoint := none\n\n/-- Distinct points are at infinite extended distance. -/\ndef counterDist : CounterPoint → CounterPoint → ENNReal :=\n  fun x y =\u0026gt; if x = y then 0 else ∞\n\n/-- HC02-P23.  This is a legal extended pseudometric with the required\nabsorbing-point isolation. -/\ntheorem counterDist_extendedPseudoMetric :\n    ExtendedPseudoMetric CounterPoint counterBot counterDist := by\n  refine\n    { nonabsorbing := ⟨some false, by simp [counterBot]⟩\n      dist_self := ?_\n      symm := ?_\n      triangle := ?_\n      isolate_bot := ?_ }\n  · intro x\n    simp [counterDist]\n  · intro x y\n    fin_cases x \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; fin_cases y \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; simp [counterDist]\n  · intro x y z\n    fin_cases x \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; fin_cases y \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; fin_cases z \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; simp [counterDist]\n  · intro x hx\n    fin_cases x \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; simp_all [counterDist, counterBot]\n\n/-- The identity operator on the counterexample space. -/\ndef counterOperator : Operator CounterPoint counterBot := ⟨id, rfl⟩\n\n/-- A nonempty legal evaluation domain containing both nonabsorbing points. -/\ndef counterU : Set CounterPoint := {some false, some true}\n\ntheorem counterU_nonempty : counterU.Nonempty := by\n  exact ⟨some false, by simp [counterU]⟩\n\ntheorem counterU_subset_dom : counterU ⊆ dom counterOperator := by\n  intro x hx\n  rcases (by simpa [counterU] using hx : x = some false ∨ x = some true) with rfl | rfl \u0026lt;;\u0026gt;\n    simp [dom, counterOperator, counterBot]\n\n/-- HC02-P23.  For the distinguished channel, the feasible scalars are\nexactly the nonzero extended nonnegative reals. -/\ntheorem counter_scalarFeasible (lam : ENNReal) :\n    lam ∈ scalarFeasible (fun _ : Unit =\u0026gt; counterDist) counterOperator counterU () () ↔\n      lam ≠ 0 := by\n  constructor\n  · intro hlam\n    intro hzero\n    subst lam\n    have hbound := hlam (some false) (by simp [counterU])\n      (some true) (by simp [counterU])\n    simp [counterOperator, counterDist] at hbound\n  · intro hne x hx y hy\n    have hx' : x = some false ∨ x = some true := by simpa [counterU] using hx\n    have hy' : y = some false ∨ y = some true := by simpa [counterU] using hy\n    rcases hx' with rfl | rfl \u0026lt;;\u0026gt; rcases hy' with rfl | rfl \u0026lt;;\u0026gt;\n      simp [counterOperator, counterDist, hne]\n\n/-- The feasible set is precisely `(0, +∞]` in `ENNReal`. -/\ntheorem counter_scalarFeasible_set :\n    scalarFeasible (fun _ : Unit =\u0026gt; counterDist) counterOperator counterU () () = Set.Ioi 0 := by\n  ext lam\n  simp [counter_scalarFeasible, pos_iff_ne_zero]\n\n/-- HC02-P23.  The channel infimum is zero, but zero is not feasible. -/\ntheorem counterexample_zero_infimum_not_attained :\n    channelLip (fun _ : Unit =\u0026gt; counterDist) counterOperator counterU () () = 0 ∧\n      (0 : ENNReal) ∉ scalarFeasible (fun _ : Unit =\u0026gt; counterDist)\n        counterOperator counterU () () := by\n  constructor\n  · rw [channelLip, counter_scalarFeasible_set]\n    apply sInf_eq_of_forall_ge_of_forall_gt_exists_lt\n    · intro a ha\n      exact zero_le a\n    · intro w hw\n      obtain ⟨a, ha, haw⟩ := exists_between hw\n      exact ⟨a, ha, haw⟩\n  · intro hzero\n    exact (counter_scalarFeasible 0).mp hzero rfl\n\nend formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"language-json\">{\n  \u0026quot;case_id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HCH02\u0026quot;,\n  \u0026quot;version\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;0.1.0\u0026quot;,\n  \u0026quot;items\u0026quot;: [\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IsRestrictedLip\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.restrictedLipCertificates\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lipCertificates\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;BoundMatrix I=I→I→ENNReal；受限成员条件同时含U⊆dom φ和∀x,y∈U、∀j的输出距≤Σi L i j*d i x y；全域族特取U=dom φ。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IsRestrictedCoLip\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.restrictedCoLipCertificates\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLipCertificates\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;co-Lip成员条件依次为U.Nonempty、U⊆dom φ和∀x,y∈U、∀j的Σi K i j*d i x y≤输出距；系数未被限制为有限值。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.BoundMatrix\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.displayMatrix\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.boundMul\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.displayMatrix_boundMul\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;M i j表示输入i到输出j；displayMatrix M j i=M i j，故j为行、i为列；boundMul M₂ M₁ i j=Σk M₂ k j*M₁ i k，并证明显示后就是普通矩阵乘法。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: []\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.boundIdentity\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.orderedProduct\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.boundMul_identity_right\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.boundMul_identity_left\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.orderedProduct_one\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;boundIdentity i j为δij；orderedProduct A 0=I，递归为A n乘以前缀，故应用顺序φ₀,…,φ(n-1)对应A(n-1)…A0；长度一等于A0。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D05\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.actualDomain\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.operatorChain\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipChainValid\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoLipChainValid\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.operatorChain_image\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.actualDomain_subset_dom\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.LipChainValid.step\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.CoLipChainValid.step\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;以前n步表示有限链，actualDomain U ϕ 0=U且succ为ϕ n的像；operatorChain与有序矩阵乘积同步。证明全复合像等于逐次像、每个实际域含于该步dom，并从局部证书构造最终证书；没有最终复合界字段。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D06\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath.intermediate\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath.weight\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath.AllPositive\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath.HasZero\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath.intermediate_length\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.IndexPath.eq_single\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;带长度和固定端点的归纳路径枚举所有中间指标序列，不附加正性；intermediate长度恰为n-1，weight为逐边乘积，AllPositive与HasZero逐边定义；n=1只有single空中间序列。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D07\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.ComponentChannel\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.RowSparse\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.RowDecoupled\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.ColumnSparse\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.ColumnDecoupled\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.Diagonal\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;通道为I×I；RowSparse L i j为∀k≠i,L k j=0，行解耦为∃i；ColumnSparse L i j为∀k≠j,L i k=0，列解耦为∃j；Diagonal为全部非对角项零。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.scalarFeasible\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.channelLip\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;在原文U⊆dom φ语境中，scalarFeasible恰为∀x,y∈U的dj(φx,φy)≤lam*di(x,y)之lam集合；channelLip取其ENNReal sInf，空集下确界为∞，不引用任何矩阵条目。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: []\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P01\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_unique\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_singleton\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;单指标Fintype上的有限和退化；lip_singleton以显式i₀和∀k,k=i₀表达I={i₀}。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P02\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_global_subset_restricted\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;对U⊆dom φ证明lipCertificates d φ⊆restrictedLipCertificates d φ U。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P03\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.restrictedLip_mono\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;U⊆V时V上的合法Lip证书逐点复用于U，得到证书族反向包含。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P04\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Basic.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.entryInf\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.entryInf_mono\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;entryInf为矩阵族在(i,j)条目像集的sInf；由U⊆V的证书族包含证明entryInf U≤entryInf V。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P05\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_comp_two\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;U₂直接取ϕ₁.func '' U₁；由两局部上界、非负乘子单调性及ENNReal有限和分配交换律得到boundMul L₂ L₁的复合证书。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P06\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_entry_eq_zero_of_output_zero\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;将dom中的点对代入全域co-Lip界，以单项≤总和及严格正乘积矛盾证明K i j=0。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P07\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_comp_two\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;与Lip复合使用同一实际像域；非空性由K₁成员条件保留，乘积下界由同一有限和代数恒等式得到。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P08\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturbation_forward\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;用两次三角不等式及对称性得到d_j(φ₂x,φ₂y)≤d_j(φ₁x,φ₁y)+δj+δj；省去了证明中不需要的公共dom假设。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: []\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P09\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturbation_reverse\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;交换两个算子复用正向扰动，得到d_j(φ₁x,φ₁y)≤d_j(φ₂x,φ₂y)+δj+δj。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-P08\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P10\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturbation_lip\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;将L₁的多分量上界代入正向扰动，右端写为Σi L₁ i j*di(x,y)+2*δj。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P08\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P11\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.perturbation_coLip\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;先使用K₁下界，再使用反向扰动，得到Σi K₁ i j*di(x,y)≤dj(φ₂x,φ₂y)+2*δj。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P09\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P12\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_orderedProduct_chain\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;对正长度n+1即原文k≥1，逐步局部合法性和实际像域经两步复合归纳，结论为Lk…L1在U上界全复合；实现还覆盖零步。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D05\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P05\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P14\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P13\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_orderedProduct_chain_aux\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_orderedProduct_chain_succ\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;正长度co-Lip链同样归纳；起始非空性从最后局部证书及逐次像非空等价推出，未另加假设。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D05\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P07\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P15\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P14\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.identity_lip\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.zero_step_unit_lip\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;空算子链为恒等，δ加权和等于dj(x,y)，故空乘积单位矩阵是合法Lip证书。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P15\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.identity_coLip\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Chains.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.zero_step_unit_coLip\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;同一非空U和δ加权和等式给出零步单位co-Lip证书。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P16\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.orderedProduct_zero_iff\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_chain_product_zero_iff\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.orderedProduct_one_zero_iff\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;在正长度Lip链语境中，乘积条目零iff每个IndexPath有零边；长度一的另列退化定理。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D05\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D06\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P17\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P17\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.orderedProduct_pos_iff\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.coLip_chain_product_pos_iff\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Paths.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.orderedProduct_one_pos_iff\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;有限和严格正iff某求和项严格正，逐层构造/读取完整路径，得到乘积正值iff存在全正路径；含n=1退化。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D04\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D05\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D06\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P18\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.scalarFeasible_eq_empty_of_zero_input_positive_output\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.channelLip_eq_top_of_zero_input_positive_output\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;任意lam乘零均为零，故正输出距使可行集为空；随之sInf∅=∞。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P19\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.channelLip_mem_of_pos_finite\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;对输入距分别讨论0、有限正、∞；有限正情形以A/B夹出a\u0026lt;lam且lam*B\u0026lt;A并矛盾，证明正有限下确界本身可行。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P20\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P21\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P20\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.scalarFeasible_upward\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;由ENNReal乘法单调性，λ₀可行且λ₀≤λ₁即λ₁可行，包含无穷距离与无穷系数。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P21\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.feasible_of_channelLip_lt\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.feasible_above_positive_finite_channelLip\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;由sInf_lt_iff取更小的可行常数再向上封闭；正有限版本的λ可等于∞。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P20\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P22\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.feasible_of_channelLip_eq_zero\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;a=0且0\u0026lt;λ\u0026lt;∞时有a\u0026lt;λ，故λ可行；不声称λ=0可行。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P21\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P23\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.counterDist_extendedPseudoMetric\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.counterU_nonempty\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.counterU_subset_dom\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.counterexample_zero_infimum_not_attained\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;在Option Bool上以none为吸收元、不同点距离为∞；恒等算子和U={some false,some true}合法，Unit通道可行集恰为(0,∞]，故下确界0但0不可行。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P24\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Channels.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.channelLip_lt_top_iff_exists_finite\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;channelLip\u0026lt;∞ iff 存在λ\u0026lt;∞且属于全部点对标量可行集。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D08\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P25\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.zero_coefficient_term\u0026quot;},\n        {\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.sum_erase_of_coefficient_zero\u0026quot;}\n      ],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;L i j=0时对应乘积项为0，并证明该输入位置可从整个有限和删除；对di=∞也成立。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P26\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.lip_row_sparse\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;合法L且∀k≠i,L k j=0时，有限和仅余L i j*di(x,y)；i与j无需相等。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D07\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P27\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.column_sparse_terms_zero\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;固定输入i的列若只可能在输出j非零，则所有k≠j的L i k*di(x,y)均为零。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D03\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D07\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P28\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.diagonal_lip_bounds\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;对角条件给出每个输出j的行稀疏，复用单行化简得到全部标量上界。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D07\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P26\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P29\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.diagonal_input_two_sided\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;上界仅由Lip第j行稀疏得到；下界由K j j*dj≤Σk K k j*dk≤输出距得到，对K无稀疏假设。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D01\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P26\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P30\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.all_components_two_sided_finite\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;对所有j同时给双侧界，并额外返回K j j\u0026lt;∞与L j j\u0026lt;∞，覆盖有限系数分支。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-P29\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P31\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.positive_coLip_channel\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;K i j\u0026gt;0且di(x,y)\u0026gt;0时，对应乘积项严格正，并不超过co-Lip总和及输出距。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;]\n    },\n    {\n      \u0026quot;id\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;HC02-P32\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;status\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;complete\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;declarations\u0026quot;: [{\u0026quot;file\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet/vol_01/ch_02_operator_bounds/Bounds.lean\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;name\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;formal_oet.vol_01.ch_02_operator_bounds.positive_diagonal_coLip_reflects\u0026quot;}],\n      \u0026quot;representation\u0026quot;: \u0026quot;若φx~Gφy而某个dj(x,y)\u0026gt;0，正对角通道与P31产生正输出距矛盾；逐j得到x~Gy。\u0026quot;,\n      \u0026quot;dependencies\u0026quot;: [\u0026quot;HC02-D02\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;HC02-P31\u0026quot;]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n","source":"assets/content/652d51a464e249806b471022566226e37bc77f822833cd1e4a795479921d8273.html"});
